@startuml
!include ../_style.puml
left to right direction
rectangle "Adaptive Application" as APP
rectangle "Executable\n(binary with one main)" as EXE
rectangle "Modelled Process\n(Process element in the manifest)" as MP
rectangle "OS process\n(has a PID)" as OSP
rectangle "Execution Manifest" as MAN
rectangle "Function Group" as FG
rectangle "Function Group States\n(Off is mandatory)" as FGS
rectangle "MachineFG" as MFG
rectangle "State Management" as SM
rectangle "Execution Management" as EM
APP --> EXE : consists of 1..n
EXE --> MP : described by 1..n
MP --> OSP : realized at run time as
MAN --> MP : configures
MP --> FG : references states of exactly one
FG --> FGS : has
MFG --> FG : is a special
SM --> EM : requests a Function Group State
EM --> OSP : starts and stops
@enduml
